= References

This reference list consolidates every citation appearing in this book's 35 chapters into one alphabetical list. Citations are reproduced exactly as given in the book's own text -- where a chapter cites an author and year without full journal details (common for NICE DSU Technical Support Documents and similar grey-literature guidance), this list does the same rather than inventing bibliographic details not present in the original text.

#v(0.5em)

